OL,3,GNEWSAPalestinian couple and teenage
OL,4,Adaughter who died in water off Shoreham
OL,5,Anamed by police
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Palestinian couple and their teenage
OL,8,Fdaughter who died after entering the
OL,9,Fwater off Shoreham, West Sussex, have
OL,10,Fbeen named by police
OL,12,FThey are Hassan El-Khawas, 55, Zeina
OL,13,FAlayn, 37, and 14-year-old Sara
OL,14,FEl-Khawas - here's what we know about
OL,15,Fthe family
OL,17,FThe Palestinian Forum in Britain says a
OL,18,Fgirl who is in a critical condition in
OL,19,Fhospital is the couple's younger
OL,20,Fdaughter and that two other children
OL,21,Fwere on the shore at the time of the
OL,22,Fincident
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
