OL,3,GNEWSAPalestinian couple and teenage
OL,4,Adaughter who died in water off Shoreham
OL,5,Anamed by police
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe forum says the family were British
OL,8,Fcitizens of Palestinian origin whose
OL,9,Fextended family had lived in the UK for
OL,10,Fmany years
OL,12,FThe family lived in London and
OL,13,Ftravelled to Shoreham, Sussex Police
OL,14,Fsay. The force also says it is working
OL,15,Fwith the coroner "to understand exactly
OL,16,Fhow this incident occurred"
OL,18,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham calls it "a
OL,19,Freal terrible family tragedy" and warns
OL,20,Fabout "the dangers of open water
OL,21,Fswimming"
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
